==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Gavel Base (Enemy Base)|Gavel Base]].
*9 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

